{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-07",
  "title": "轰鸣",
  "storyCode": "3-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e874a13b3e4fea0c33d93f80392de71055f868ee38c5116d3c7551f48b446b0c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "第一防线突破！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "术师在做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敌人的先锋明明只有一个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么就看着她把我们的阵线撕得粉碎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快，快！攻击她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "芙兰卡！你脱离了安全距离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我没法......没法掩护你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我也不像是会做些毫无把握的事的人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "小心四点钟方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "雷蛇，你该出场了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "麻烦帮我抵挡一下敌人的远程攻击，谢谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快！快啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先压制住那个拿剑的家伙再说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "成功了吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "还是算了吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "就凭这种......丢石块一样的伎俩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这家伙......从，从哪里跳下来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "欠你个人情，龙门的大个子长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "合作愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不过，芙兰卡，你的任务明明是佯攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "可你却......一路拼斗，甚至深入敌阵到了这里。你们的目标太明显了，真的不要紧吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "没关系，都这种时候了，要相信自己的可靠搭档才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "芙兰卡！你冲太前面了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你看，她跟上来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我可不擅长攻坚战啊......！为什么你会突然冲进敌人当中，搞不懂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "混账......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "近卫局和罗德岛，居然串通好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样下去，我们根本不可能守住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来不及了，必须赌一赌，大家一起上吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "敌人径直向我们冲了过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "既然你们执意要抵抗到底，那就别怪我依法办事了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "长官，你......很有力气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "这整合运动，真的很不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "敢攻击我和我的队友——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "可怜的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "他们应该向那些枉死的人道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "星熊督察！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你们也没有受伤，太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们和企鹅物流击溃了敌方的侧翼，接下来，就是总攻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "看来一切进行得十分顺利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "接下来——可就不一定了。 敌人设置了许多障碍物，埋伏也十分隐蔽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "阿米娅，做好苦战的准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "罗德岛的Dr.{@nickname}，一定要多加侦察，注意保护你自己的队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "大家......我们一起去把米莎救出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
